Open Source Project (Google), under the BSD 3-clause license, with the copyrights
"Google Inc.", "Google LLC" or "The Android Open Source Project" at the
top of each file (those that add "Rive" also carry Rive's copyright):

- `runtime/src/math/bezier_utils.cpp`, `runtime/include/rive/math/bezier_utils.hpp` and
  `runtime/include/rive/math/wangs_formula.hpp`;
- `runtime/src/math/mat2d_scale.cpp`: "Copyright 2006 The Android Open Source Project",
  imported from Skia's `src/core/SkMatrix.cpp`;
- `runtime/renderer/include/rive/renderer/sk_rectanizer_skyline.hpp`,
  `runtime/renderer/src/sk_rectanizer_skyline.cpp`, `runtime/renderer/src/gr_triangulator.cpp`,
  `runtime/renderer/src/gr_triangulator.hpp`, `runtime/renderer/src/gr_inner_fan_triangulator.hpp`,
  `runtime/renderer/src/shaders/bezier_utils.glsl` and `runtime/renderer/src/shaders/tessellate.glsl`;
- `runtime/skia/pngprefix/pngprefix.h`;
- `runtime/tests/gm/`: 23 files whose header states a Google copyright (for example
  `strokes.cpp`, `convexpaths.cpp`, `beziers.cpp`);
- `runtime/tests/unit_tests/renderer/sk_rectanizer_test.cpp`,
  `runtime/tests/unit_tests/renderer/triangulator_test.cpp`,
  `runtime/tests/unit_tests/runtime/bezier_utils_test.cpp`, `simd_test.cpp` and
  `wangs_formula_test.cpp`;
- `web/rive-wasm/wasm/src/skia_imports/`: Skia files (`SkSize.h`, `SkVx.h`, `GrRectanizer*`, etc.).

The text of Skia's BSD 3-clause license is reproduced in
`web/rive-wasm/js/npm/webgl2/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES` (section "Skia and Android Open Source
Project code"), because the Skia repository is not included.

WebGPU and Dawn headers

`runtime/renderer/src/webgpu/wagyu-port/` contains WebGPU headers, under BSD 3-clause,
whose text is in each header:

- `include/webgpu/webgpu.h`: "Copyright (c) 2019, "WebGPU native" developers";
- `include/webgpu/webgpu_cpp.h`, `webgpu_cpp_chained_struct.h` and
  `webgpu_enum_class_bitmasks.h`: "Copyright 2017" or "2023 The Dawn & Tint Authors".

The other files in this folder (`webgpu_wagyu.h`, `src/`, `webgpu-port.py`) carry
no license header of their own. `runtime/renderer/path_fiddle/fiddle_context_dawn_helper.mm`
carries "Copyright 2020 The Dawn Authors", Apache License 2.0 (text in its header).

