Test files

The test and resource files taken from upstream (`.riv`, `.sriv`, audio,
fonts, images, JSON) are mostly under `runtime/tests/unit_tests/assets/`,
`runtime/tests/unit_tests/silvers/`, `runtime/tests/web_scripting/` and `web/rive-wasm/js/test/assets/`. Upstream's MIT
covers the code; nothing in this repository establishes that it covers these resources.
They are provided as is, without warranty, and are not works of Tweenora.
For those the demo uses, the known provenance is in
`web/examples/ASSETS_PROVENANCE.md`.

If you hold rights in any of these files and want it removed,
open an issue at https://github.com/fiaaaansoo/tweenora/issues stating
the path of the file and what establishes your rights. Tweenora replies within 7 days
and removes the file from the repository if the request is well founded.
